UV yi meun gnou indil sa der ay diafé diafé sa der, tél la maguetlo, reslo der, wala cancer ou der.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":605,"row":{"en":"Then I turn it over and begin to write Dearest Ted, I write. I'm having the time of my life here in Italy.","wo":"Ba noppi ma wëlbatiko tàmbali bind, Salaam Ted. Ba noppi ma dellu ni, maa ngi dundu luma musul dundu fii ci Italie.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa noppi ma weulbatiko tambali bind, salam ted. Ba noppi ma dellou ni mangui doundou louma mussoul doundou fii thi italié.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":606,"row":{"en":"I agree, replied Jo. We all need to follow the rules of the road and drive defensively.","wo":"Jo tontu, Dëgg nga wax, fàww ñu topp digle yi sooy dawal ba noppi ba baña xél.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJo tontou, deug nga wakh faw gnou top digle yi sooy dawal ba nopi ba bagna hel.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":607,"row":{"en":"As I got older, we added a few more animals to the mix, including a rabbit, a guinea pig, and a hamster.","wo":"Bi gëna jëm mag, danu yokk yeneen baayima jaxase ngir jaxase leen, lu ci melni lëk, naat ak hamster.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi geuna dieum mag daniou yok yenen bayima diakhassé nguir diakhassé len lou thi melni leuk naat ak hamster\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":608,"row":{"en":"You should also take pictures of the car before you drive it away.","wo":"Danga wara foto oto bi laata nga koy yóbbu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanga wara foto auto bi laata ga koy yobou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":609,"row":{"en":"The power generation industry is estimated to expand at a rapid pace during the forecast period.","wo":"Liggéeyukaay yi defar kuuraŋ ñu ngi jàpp ni ñu ngi gëna am doole ci diiru meteo bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLigueyoukay yi defar courant gnoungui diap ni gnoungui geuna ame dolé ci diirou météo bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":610,"row":{"en":"These goals can be anything you want them to be, but they should be specific, measurable, achievable, relevant, and time-bound.","wo":"Mébet yooyu ñooy lépp loo bëgga sottal, waaye dañu wara leer, ñu mën leen natt, def, am njariñ, nga mën ko def ci waxtu wi nga jàpp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMébet yoyou gnoy lép lo beuga sottal wayé daniou wara leer, gnou meun len natt, def, ame ndiarigne, nga meun ko def thi wakhtou wi nga diap.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":611,"row":{"en":"We are here to protest the injustice that is being done to our people.","wo":"Danu fi ñëw ngir ŋàññi jaay doole gi ñuy teg sunuy nit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanou fi nieuw nguir ngani djay dolé gui gnuy teg souniouy nitt.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":612,"row":{"en":"This means that the wealth is concentrated in the hands of a few, while the majority of the population lives in poverty.","wo":"Maanaam alal ji dafa nekk ci loxo nit ñu néew, fekk li ëpp ci askan wi a ngi dundu ci ndóol.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nManaam alal dji dafa nekk thi lokho nitt gnou néw fekk li eup thi askan wi angi doundou thi ndol.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":613,"row":{"en":"Child: I can't believe how big space is.","wo":"Xale bi: Mënu ma ni jawwu ji nii la yaatoo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé bi: Meunouma ni diaw dji niii la yaato.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":614,"row":{"en":"Or perhaps it is their intelligence, as they are capable of learning a wide variety of tasks.","wo":"Wala mën nekk itam liñu am xol mu neex, ndax mën nañu jàng mbir yu bari te wuute.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWala meun nekk itam lignou ame khol mou nekh ndakh meun nagnou diang mbir you bari té wouté\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":615,"row":{"en":"She had been trying to sell matches all day, but no one had bou