his place for as long as you like.","wo":"Mayal sa yaram mu bàyyeeku ci barab bii ba nga doyal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMayal sa yaram mou bayéko ci barab bi bagua doyalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":633,"row":{"en":"In addition to sweeping, dusting, or vacuuming, you should also occasionally wipe your cork flooring with a damp mop.","wo":"Lu weesu bale, fomp, wala aspirer, yenn saa fàww nga jël morso bu xawa tooy nga fomp dëru liege bi bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou wessou balé fomp wala aspiré yéne saa faw nga dieul morso bou khawa toy nga fomp derou liege bi bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":634,"row":{"en":"I'm good","wo":"Maa ngi ci jàmm","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMangui si diam rek\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":635,"row":{"en":"Creating camp experiences that truly transform lives takes leadership.","wo":"Amal camp bu nit ñi di mëna jàngee lu leen di indil yokkute ci seen dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAmal camp bou nitt gni di meuna diangue lou lene di indil yokoute si sene doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":636,"row":{"en":"But what happens when you bring a bike into a small room?","wo":"Waaye ana luy xew soo indee velo ci néeg bu ndaw?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé ana louy kheuw so indé vélo thi néegue bou ndaw ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":637,"row":{"en":"The matching shirt and tie nearly tipped me over the edge, though the pants were ugly.","wo":"Chemise bi ak cravate bi neexoon nañu ma lool doonte pantalon bi daa ñaaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nChemise bi ak cravate bi nékhone nagnou ma lole donté pantalon bi da niaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":638,"row":{"en":"They offer a variety of goods and services, from fresh produce to handmade crafts.","wo":"Xeeti mbir yuñ fay jaay barina, liko dalee ci produit yu fere ak ay yëfi art.","no