":"Merchant cash advance providers evaluate risk and weight credit criteria differently than a traditional banker might.","wo":"Ñi lebal baana-baana yi xaalis, wuute nañu ak bànk yi ni ñuy xoole risk yi ak li ñuy laaj ngir ñu lebal la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGni lebal bana bana yi khalis wouté nagnou ak bank yi ni gnuy kholé risque yi ak li gnuy ladj nguir gnou lebal la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":645,"row":{"en":"Sarah and I went outside to play on the playground.","wo":"Man ak Sarah nu dem ci ëtt bi di fo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMane ak Sarah gnou dem thi eutt bi di foo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":646,"row":{"en":"You'll find everything from grilled meats to fresh seafood to traditional desserts.","wo":"Lépp loo fa bëgg mën nga ko am, liko dalee ci meññeefi géej ba ci deseeri aada.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLepp loo fa beug meun nga ko ame, liko dalé thi meugnefi guedj ba thi dessert yi aada.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":647,"row":{"en":"Nevertheless, each division follows general laws and rules.","wo":"Teerewul, xaaj bu nekk dafa topp loi ak sàrt yiñ tëral.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTérewoul khadj bou neuk dafa top loi ak sart yign teural.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":648,"row":{"en":"Then came the implementation phase again; I wanted a perfect automation process, coding style, following framework rules etc;","wo":"Ci la wàllu samp gi dellusiwaat, ma soxla otomaasioŋ bu baax, stilu codage, topp sàrti kaadar bi, ak ñoom seen;","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi la wallou samp gui dellousiwate ma sokhla otomaasion bou bakh stilou codage top sarti kaadar bi ak gnom sen\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":649,"row":{"en":"Themes of greed and revenge lead to a stunning surprise ending (genre: crime fiction)","wo":"Temu foqale ak fayyu dafay mujjee ci njeexte lu yéeme (xeet wi: krimu fiksioŋ)","non_standar