NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":656,"row":{"en":"He had heard stories about the old boat, and he was eager to see it for himself.","wo":"Dafa yàgg a dégg ay jaar-jaari gaal gi, muni woon na ñëw xoolal boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa yagg a deg ay jaar jaari gaal gui mouni wone na gnew kholal bopam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":657,"row":{"en":"Michael Johnson concurred and stated it also met significant aspects of the zoning.","wo":"Michael Johnson bokkoon na ci ñi ko doon wut ba noppi waxni daje na ak zoning bi ci anam yu bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMichael Johnson bokon na thi gni ko done wout ba noppi wakh ni dadjé na ak zoning bi thi anam you bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":658,"row":{"en":"As the flame grew, the little girl saw that it was a magic match.","wo":"Bi xal yi di jëm kaw, xale bu jigéen bi gis ni alumet yi dañu am luñu àndal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi khal yi di dieum kaw, khalé bou djiguéne bi guiss ni alumet yi daniou ame lougnou andal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":659,"row":{"en":"But brick and mortar can’t compete with consumers', especially Millennials', demand for online convenience.","wo":"Waaye brik ak gënn mënuñoo jongante ak ñiy konsome, espesialma Millennial yi, laajtel piix ci jokkolantey internet bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé brik ak guenn meunounio jonganté ak gnii konsomé, espesialma Millennial yi, ladjtal piix ci jokkolantéy internet bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":660,"row":{"en":"I took a sip of my drink and glanced across the table at the woman I’d been on a few dates with.","wo":"Ma jël sama kaas guux tuuti, siggi xool ndaw si jàkkaarloo ak man ci taabal ji, bi ñu tàmbalee gise yàggul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa dieul sama kaas goukh touti siggi khol ndaw si diakarlo ak mane thi taabal dji bi gnou tambalé guissé yaggoul\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":661,"row":{"en":"My assessment is that, given the circumstances, we have to be diligent in our work and stingy in our purchases.","wo":"Dama yaakaar ni boo seetee ni mbir yi di demee, dañu wara góor-góorlu ci sunu liggéey te moytu yàq xaalis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama yakar ni bo seté ni mbir yi di démé daniou wara goor-goorlou si souniou liguey té moytou yak khaliss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":662,"row":{"en":"This app, developed by William Studio, is mainly for anime character creation.","wo":"Li gëna waral aplikaasioŋ bu studio William defar mooy defar ay personage filmu animaasioŋ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi geuna waral application bou studio william defar moy defar ay personnage filmou animation.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":663,"row":{"en":"The first humans appeared on Earth about 200,000 years ago.","wo":"Bi nit njëkkee wàcci ci kaw Suuf ak leegi defna luy tollu ci 200,000 at.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi nitt nieuké watthi thi kaw souf ak légui defna louy tollou thi 200000 att.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":664,"row":{"en":"I abide by my belief that we must endure and maintain good cheer without exception, no matter how arbitrary our plan is.","wo":"Mangi and ak sama ngëm ngëm ni deñu wara dëkku ak nekk ak yaakar bu baax ñun ñëpp, ak bu fekke ni sax suñu doxalin teguwul ci yoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMangui ande ak sama ngeum ngeum ni degnou wara deukou ak nekk ak yakar bou bakh nioune gneup, ak bou feke ni sakh souniou dokhaline teguwoul thi yone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":665,"row":{"en":"It took me a while to adjust to city life, but eventually I came to love it.","wo":"Teelu ma miin dundu ville, waaye demnaa ba mujj koo bëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTélouma mine doundou ville wayé démna ba moudj ko beugue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":666,"row"