uy jëfandikoo ay jumtukaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ngnay bayima bou ame khel la té guiss nagnou léne gnuy dieufandiko ay jumtoukay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":684,"row":{"en":"At first, I was overwhelmed by the noise, the traffic, and the crowds.","wo":"Lima njëkka yéem mooy xumbaay bi, oto yu bari yi ak nit ñu bari ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima ndieuka yém moy khoumbay bi, auto you bari yi ak nitt gnou bari gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":685,"row":{"en":"He faced discrimination and hardship throughout his life, but he never gave up on his dream of equality for all Indians.","wo":"Dundam dafa musa metti, ñu ky xeex, waaye musul xàddi, te doonoon mébetam mooy ñu yamale bépp doomu Inde.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDoundam dafa meussa meti, gnou koy kheukh wayé meusoul khaddi té donone mbeuteum moy gnou yamalé beup domou Inde.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":686,"row":{"en":"Elena: That's an interesting idea.","wo":"Elena: Loolu xalaat bu am solo la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nElena: Loolou khalaat bou am solo la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":687,"row":{"en":"* 1/2 cup (1 stick) unsalted butter, at room temperature","wo":"* 1/2 kaasu (1 bant) bër bu amul xorom, bu nekkul ci frigo","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n1/2 kaassou (1 bant) beur bou amoul khorom, bou neukoul thi frigo\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":688,"row":{"en":"Divide the sliced steak, roasted potato, and cooked snap peas between two plates.","wo":"Xaajaleel steak biñ daggate, pomme de terre biñ roti, ak pois biñ togg ci ñaari palaat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhajalél steak bign dagaté, pomme de terre bign roti ak pois bign togue ci gnaari palat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":689,"row":{"en":"This helped to reach people in need who would not have otherwise been able to access the organization's resources.","w